  "Freedom is not a gift they hand you — it's a wound you inflict on their control."
  "When justice wears the face of the oppressor, defiance becomes the only honest act."
  "The archives of history are full of rebels, not of those who bowed and smiled."
  "If comfort is the price of your chains, you've already paid too much."
  "The crown only stands because the people haven't decided to sit down yet."
  "Truth won't topple a tyrant — but it sharpens the blade of those who will."
  "You can't bargain with a system built to bury you."
  "When they call your cage a homeland, burning it down is the patriotic act."
  "The machine isn't malfunctioning — destroying you is exactly what it was built to do."
  "They never freed you — they just lengthened your leash and called it progress."
  "Every uniform that stands between power and accountability is a monument to cowardice."
  "Tearing it down isn't violence — it's the first act of honest construction."
  "Oppression feeds on your desire to keep things civil."
  "Real change doesn't ask for your old self's permission."
  "Kindness shown to those who devour the weak is just complicity with better manners."
  "You become dangerous the moment you stop needing their approval."
  "What they call peace is just the sound of those who gave up."
  "The most unbreakable chains are the ones the prisoner helps forge."
  "Patience can outlast empires — but only if you're building something while you wait."
  "Not every fire is destruction — some are the only light left."
  "They gave you the right to speak and built the walls that made sure no one heard."
  "The most radical act in a broken world is refusing to pretend it isn't."
  "A man always at war forgets who he was before the first shot — choose your battles or lose yourself."
  "Authority doesn't corrupt power — it just makes the corruption harder to see."
  "The quiet ones don't lack fury — they've simply learned where to aim it."
  "Bending without breaking isn't weakness — it's how rivers carve through stone."
  "You don't defeat chaos — you become fluent in it."
  "Every wall you build tells the story of what you're afraid of."
  "No comfort was ever worth the spine it cost."
  "Most people were never truly tested — and those in power are counting on that."
  "Winning every fight means you've been in too many — pick the hill worth dying on."
  "A still mind will outlast ten loud ones every single time."
  "Those who've stared into the dark don't fear it — they use it."
  "A scar is just your body's record of the moment you refused to quit."
  "Revolt starts not with a weapon but with the decision to stop pretending."
  "Ruling others is easy — ruling yourself when everything burns is the real test."
  "Chase it forever and it owns you; stop running and suddenly you hold the ground."
  "Even the most relentless hunger eventually turns inward if it finds nothing left to consume."
  # --- Real quotes ---
  "The most potent weapon in the hands of the oppressor is the mind of the oppressed. — Steve Biko"
  "If there is no struggle, there is no progress. — Frederick Douglass"
  "An unjust law is no law at all. — Augustine of Hippo"
  "The only way to deal with an unfree world is to become so absolutely free that your very existence is an act of rebellion. — Albert Camus"
  "Those who make peaceful revolution impossible will make violent revolution inevitable. — JFK"
  "When the whole world is silent, even one voice becomes powerful. — Malala Yousafzai"
  "You may choose to look the other way, but you can never say again that you did not know. — William Wilberforce"
  "Disobedience is the true foundation of liberty. — Henry David Thoreau"
  "I am no longer accepting the things I cannot change — I am changing the things I cannot accept. — Angela Davis"
  "Oppression can only survive through silence. — Carmen de Monteflores"
)

ignite() {
  local len=${#quotes[@]}
  local idx=$(( RANDOM % len ))
  echo "${quotes[$idx]}"
}

ignite